    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +3 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of performing a critical hit & damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Recovers 15% HP\n- Extreme Class allies' ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g}, plus an additional\nchance of performing a critical hit 10%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters who\nalso belong to the \"Majin Power\" Category\n*Per \"Sworn Enemies\" or \"Majin Buu Saga\" Category ally on the team\n(depending on which Category has more members)*\n- ATK 100%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 500%)\n*When there is another \"Sworn Enemies\" or \"Majin Buu Saga\"\nCategory ally attacking in the same turn*\n- ATK & DEF 300%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 55%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking for the 1st time*\n- The more HP remaining, the greater the ATK boost within the turn\n(up to 1000%{passiveImg:up_g})\n*If HP is 60% or more when attacking*\n- Chance of performing a critical hit 20%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When receiving an attack*\n- DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}",
